nality.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal A\\in V\">\\(\\mathfrak a,\\mathcal A\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcComb7MaximalAlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcComb7MaximalAlmostDisjointFamily}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"bc7af8bf7c8befb3\" href=\"?note=bc7af8bf7c8befb3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb7-maximal-almost-disjoint-family.md\">../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb7-maximal-almost-disjoint-family.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCiAlmostDisjointnessNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCiAlmostDisjointnessNumber}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|A|\">\\(|A|\\)</span> 为集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的唯一基数，使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2be08d4ee8aa1590\" href=\"?note=2be08d4ee8aa1590\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md\">../batch15/58-df-cardinality.md</a> 的基数函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对非空序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\min C\">\\(\\min C\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\">\\(m\\in C\\land\\forall\\xi\\in C\\;(m\\subseteq\\xi)\\)</span> 的唯一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span>；此记号仅在其非空域使用。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjointness\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiAlmostDisjointnessNumber}_S(\\mathfrak a)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak a)\n\\land\\mathfrak a=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb7MaximalAlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land|\\mathcal A|\\geq\\omega\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ci\\text{-}almost\\text{-}disjointness\\text{-}number}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcCiAlmostDisjointnessNumber}_S(\\mathfrak a)\n\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mathfrak a)\n\\land\\mathfrak a=\\min\\left\\{|\\mathcal A|:\n\\mathrm{ZfcComb7MaximalAlmostDisjointFamily}_S(\\mathcal A)\\land|\\mathcal A|\\geq\\omega\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the least cardinality of an infinite maximal almost-disjoint family on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>; the infinitude clause excludes degenerate finite maximal families such as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\omega\\}\">\\(\\{\\omega\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-zfc-comb7-maximal-almost-disjoint-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"bc7af8bf7c